   notices, and rights associated with their original repositories and
   submitters. See `THIRD_PARTY_DATA_NOTICE.md`, `DATA_INVENTORY.md`, and
   `DATASET_ACCESSIONS_AND_LINKS.md`.

When using this repository, cite both the associated manuscript and the
version-specific Zenodo record when available.
